# 统一以 LF 入库，Windows 检出时由核心配置决定工作区换行（文件内容本身不因平台漂移）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.msi binary
*.dll binary

# 锁文件按文本处理，便于审查依赖变更
Cargo.lock text eol=lf
package-lock.json text eol=lf
